om2
note build.om: the INTERPLANE research pages as one seeded Omega program. A filter: stdin is one mode
note line, then the registry (research/registry/catalog.tsv); stdout is one document. No scripts are emitted.
note Mode line: M <tab> mode [<tab> slug]. Modes: index css json bib txt slugs work wjson wbib.
note Registry lines are tab-separated facts (README.md "Registry"). Every field is escaped for the
note document it goes into (HTML, JSON, BibTeX, a URL query). Exit 0 on success, 1 when stdout fails,
note 2 for an unknown mode, 3 when the slug names no work.
global ib uchar 262144
global ibl ulong 1
global ob uchar 2097152
global obl ulong 1
